    "text": "By City News Service ,\n4 hours ago SAN DIEGO (CNS) - San Diego County political leaders roundly condemned Wednesday's fatal shooting of conservative commentator Charlie Kirk during a speech in Utah, saying political violence is never acceptable. Kirk, 31, was speaking at an event attended by hundreds of people on the campus of Utah Valley University when... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
